## Resource Plan
- **Total team:** 5.8 FTE (+ 0.3 FTE external Kafka consultant for Phase 1)
- **Duration:** 28 weeks (6.5 months)
- **Key dependencies:** Security team availability for reviews; consumer team capacity
- **Contingency headcount:** 0.5 FTE (available for unexpected complexity)

## Budget Tracking
- **Monthly burn rate:** ~$160K (Personnel: $130K, Infrastructure: $30K)
- **Forecast to complete:** $1.045M (original estimate)
- **Variance threshold:** ±10% ($104K) — triggers review at Finance

