# Quality, Testing & Acceptance

## Quality Standards
- **Code quality:** SonarQube: Technical debt ratio <5%
- **Test coverage:** >80% for all new code
- **Performance:** p95 latency <100ms; p99 <200ms
- **Security:** Zero critical findings from security scan

## Testing Strategy
- **Unit tests:** Every API endpoint and business logic
- **Integration tests:** REST API to database and message queue
- **UAT:** 3 pilot consumers validate functionality
- **Performance testing:** Load test at 2x production volume
- **Security testing:** OAuth flow validation + penetration test

## Acceptance Criteria
- **Technical:** All REST APIs meet performance/security targets
- **Consumer:** 3+ pilot consumers in production with zero data loss
- **Operational:** Monitoring/alerting fully operational
- **Business:** Integration time reduced to ≤7 days for new consumers

